<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers two discount T-bill issues Monday.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers two discount T-bill issues Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer two issues of discount T-bills worth 28 billion levs and maturities of one week and four weeks respectively at auctions on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	 BG 3011097006	BG3011197004</p>
<p> Par value	    8.0 billion levs   20 billion levs</p>
<p> Auction date	 January 20, 1996   January 20, 1997</p>
<p> Issue date	   January 22, 1997   January 22, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	January 29, 1997   February 19, 1997</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
